# Source material, kept locally only.
#
# These folders are inputs used when authoring content, never read by the app,
# the build or the tests. They are not committed because:
#   - books/ holds copyrighted Oxford University Press course PDFs (~43 MB);
#   - test/ holds photographs of a completed personal test paper;
#   - vocabulary/ is an old hand-made word list that is not trusted anyway.
#
# Everything derived from them is committed: the question bank in content/,
# the verified test analysis in content/beginner/imported-quick-test.ts,
# and the reasoning in docs/decisions.md.
# Anchored to the repository root: `vocabulary/` unanchored also matched
# content/beginner/vocabulary/ and src/pages/vocabulary/, which are real code.
/books/
/test/
/vocabulary/
